{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026s7o1ccVfwz1795790259.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>銅鑼灣冬日小鎮開幕。</p><p></p><p>文體旅局局長羅淑佩、旅發局主席林建岳等出席。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS.CWB-2200_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UHP4JU61nP1795790718.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS.CWB-2200_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zOG3a0OpiL1795790248.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>銅鑼灣冬日小鎮位於利園一帶，主題是精靈村，恩平道和希慎道都會掛上聖誕裝飾，也設有戶外精靈酒吧。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS.CWB-2200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pLWCciJvj31795790359.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS.CWB-2200_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262eMel4ZIAj1795790406.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>今年旅發局的「香港繽紛冬日巡禮」有三個冬日小鎮，分別位於中環、銅鑼灣和尖沙咀。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.XMAS.CWB-2200_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263TJdQdb83p1795790448.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>光影表演也會提前從6時開始，至晚上11時。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:23:53.320920+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T21:57:34.666430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:15.959383+00:00","content_hash":"7021f3aaa14be2b1dfeec1b4c950d019f07b0e992efa0dd2ec3b9fd958d1f78b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}